Changes made to the original works:
- Ported from Minecraft 1.20.1 and Forge (the machinery mods) and from official Botania (Applied Botanics) to
  Minecraft 1.21.1, NeoForge 21.1 and Botania Revived 1.0.3: data components, recipe inputs, block capabilities,
  payload networking, the 1.21 data formats and LibX 1.21.
- Moved every item, block, block entity, recipe, tag, loot table, lang key, texture and config to the
  appliedbotanicalmachinery namespace, and the Java code to the appliedbotanicalmachinery package.
- Merged the three mods' entry points, creative tabs and data generators into one.
- The MythicBotany integration of both machinery mods now uses Masterful Botany, the Botania Revived port of
  MythicBotany.
- Restored two Applied Botanics 1.5.2 fixes that the 1.21.1 port had lost.
